Z||000003||SCCA FIERO||02-08-2000||10:14 PM||||4 of us here in puttsville? WOW, I thought I was the sadest soul in this Forum... now I feel better  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. You guys (kidzwheelz and FIEROCIOUS) autocross? I have an 88 Coupe I put through it's paces with URSCCA and would like some company. Sounds like you're interested and I recommend you come show me what another Fiero will do so I have something to compare my times with. I have beaten many cars (even before PAX indexing) that are much more advanced than my little Fiero, but no Fieros to match times to. The season doesn't start until April (I think) so you don't have to say NO (like Mike did  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">) so soon. <P>One of you guys is from Ogden? I'm sorry.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
